WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Standing light kick begins the recorded light link.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.950
OD Freeflow Strikes follows the three-light link.

3
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:02.300
The first OD punch follow-up continues the rekka.

4
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:02.650
The second OD punch follow-up launches Ryu before Level 2.

5
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.950
Jamie activates Level 2 from the OD rekka.

6
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:05.450
Raw-Rush standing light kick catches Ryu’s fall.

7
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.150
Heavy Swagger Step follows the light kick.

8
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.350
The temporary full-stock Palm follow-up completes the juggle.
